  "description": "I kept missing the ongoing events, or had trouble finding what I was looking for in the Intel screen later on. So I made an...\n\nEventLogger\nA small utility mod that adds a searchable event log to the Intel screen that captures the ongoing in-game event corner pop-ups.\n\nSafe to add/remove mid-game\n\nFeatures\n\nCaptures the events you actually see in-game: new items in the Intel list plus corner popups (e.g. \"Colony Growth\"), with the in-game date ([Dec 23, c225]) and the event's own icon.\nAdds an Events button next to the existing sub-tabs on the Intel screen, with its own number hotkey (shown on the button).\nNewest-first list with live search (starts filtering at 3 characters).\nClick a row to open that event in the Intel list; hover a row to see its full in-game tooltip.\nA live \"N events this session\" counter and a Clear button.\nIn-memory only: nothing is written to the campaign save or to disk. The list is empty after a restart.\n\nDownloads\n||    ||    ||\n\nDependencies\nNativeUI\n\nDownload: https://github.com/WolframSegler/NativeUI/releases/download/v0.5.0/NativeUI.zip\n\nLunaLib: soft dependency to configure maximum number of stored events via in-game mod settings\n\nForums: https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=25658\nDownload: https://github.com/Lukas22041/LunaLib/releases/latest/download/LunaLib.zip\n\nScreenshots\n\nAI use disclaimer\nSubstantial code in this mod were created using AI tools:\nCode: Qwen3.8/Radiance (local model)\n\nEnjoy :)\n\nAuthor/Social",
  "descriptionHtml": "I kept missing the ongoing events, or had trouble finding what I was looking for in the Intel screen later on. So I made an...<br><br><span class=\"size-biggest\">EventLogger</span><br>A small utility mod that adds a searchable event log to the Intel screen that captures the ongoing in-game event corner pop-ups.<br><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table style=\"--bg:#d6e8d4;--pad:6px 12px\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"author-colour\" style=\"--c:#1d5e1d\"><b>Safe to add/remove mid-game</b></td></tr></tbody></table></div><br><br><span class=\"size-bigger\">Features</span><br><ul><li>Captures the events you actually see in-game: new items in the Intel list plus corner popups (e.g. \"Colony Growth\"), with the in-game date ([Dec 23, c225]) and the event's own icon.</li><li>Adds an Events button next to the existing sub-tabs on the Intel screen, with its own number hotkey (shown on the button).</li><li>Newest-first list with live search (starts filtering at 3 characters).</li><li>Click a row to open that event in the Intel list; hover a row to see its full in-game tooltip.</li><li>A live \"N events this session\" counter and a Clear button.</li><li>In-memory only: nothing is written to the campaign save or to disk. The list is empty after a restart.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"size-bigger\">Downloads</span><br><a href=\"https://git.dest-unreachable.net/d-u.net/starsector-eventlogger/releases/download/1.5.2/EventLogger-1.5.2.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/gitea/v/release/d-u.net/starsector-eventlogger?gitea_url=https%3A%2F%2Fgit.dest-unreachable.net&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=forgejo\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></a>  ||  <a href=\"https://trilink.wispborne.com/open.html?mod=%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgit.dest-unreachable.net%2Fd-u.net%2Fstarsector-eventlogger%2Fsrc%2Fbranch%2Fmain%2FEventLogger.version%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eventLogger%22%2C%22ve